# Line-ending policy (R2-8).
#
# Without this file every checkout produced "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings for ~40 files
# on Windows, which buries real diff noise and made it impossible to tell an accidental EOL
# rewrite from a content change. Text is normalized to LF in the repository; the working copy
# follows the platform default.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary

# Generated payload and build output are ignored (see .gitignore) - these entries only spell out
# that, if they are ever added explicitly, they are not text.
plugins/** -text
dist/** -text
